      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 scale on CrFeCoNiAl remains coherent.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-containing alloy develops lower oxide/alloy interfacial stress than the Si- and Mn-containing alloys.",
